@host = http://localhost:5090

### List books (filter, stable title order, paging)
GET {{host}}/api/books?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### Group books by category
GET {{host}}/api/books/by-category
Accept: application/json

### Overdue loans still out
GET {{host}}/api/loans/overdue-summary
Accept: application/json

### Unpaid fine totals
GET {{host}}/api/fines/totals
Accept: application/json

### Checkout The Hobbit (book 2) to Ada Lovelace (patron 1)
POST {{host}}/api/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patronId": 1,
  "bookId": 2
}

### Grace Hopper (patron 2) is blocked by an unpaid fine
POST {{host}}/api/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patronId": 2,
  "bookId": 2
}

### Alan Turing (patron 3) is inactive
POST {{host}}/api/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patronId": 3,
  "bookId": 2
}
